              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">SpaceWalk E1L Pro</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$152.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$189.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Up to 12% incline, 350 lb rating, app</td></tr>
