          <p>
            Where a range is shown, UREVO sold the model in more than one version (usually colour or a bundle) at different
            prices. Every model except the Foldi 3S was in stock. Speeds, belt sizes and weight limits vary by listing for
            some UREVO models; our <a href="/urevo-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">UREVO guide</a> sets out where UREVO’s own pages, Amazon and
            manuals disagree, so check the exact listing before you buy for a weight limit.
          </p>
        </div>

