            close the gap if you prefer to buy direct; read its terms first.
          </p>
          <p>
            One warning about Amazon listings. Our walking-pad pages have found UREVO listings whose title names one model
            and whose features describe another; on 27 November one listing we had tracked as the Strol 2E described a 6%
            auto-incline pad with a 5 mph running mode. Read the feature bullets, not just the title, and match the
            incline, belt and weight limit to the model you want.
          </p>
