              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Cybergoing T10</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$141.77 (Amazon)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Fixed 7% manual incline, 300 lb, Bosch motor per the listing</td></tr>
